factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 7 problems
  The reel_script says the valve area is 3 ft deep, but the article says the water stands about 3 ft deep in a pit; the draft's 'valve area' wording mixes the valve location with the depth of the water pit.
  The caption says the water 'stands like a pond' in the valve area, but the article does not say that the valve area itself has water; the phrasing merges the valve and the pit into one location.
  The caption says 'இதுவரை நடவடிக்கை எடுக்கப்படவில்லை' and that social activists 'accused' authorities, but the article only says activists stated no action was taken and officials should pay attention; 'குற்றம் சாட்டியுள்ளனர்' (accused) is an added characterization.
  The reel_script says 'இதுவரை நடவடிக்கை எடுக்கப்படவில்லை' (no action has been taken so far); the article only says action was not taken, with no 'so far' timeframe.
  The slides_spec line 'குழாய் உடைப்பு, வால்வு பழுதால் நீர் வீணாவதற்கு நடவடிக்கை' is ungrammatical and does not clearly convey that no action has been taken; it is unclear in Tamil.
  The slides_spec 'மக்கள் கருத்து' (public opinion) label is inaccurate: the quoted views come from social activists, not the public.
  The caption describes the valve as 'பிரதான குடிநீர் குழாயில் பொருத்தப்பட்டுள்ள' which is fine, but the caption says 'வால்வு பழுதால் குடிநீர் வீணாகி வருகிறது' while the headline says the valve is 'சீரமைக்கப்படாததால் மக்கள் அதிருப்தி' (public discontent), an attribution to the public that the article attributes only to activists.
